		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Human skeleton dripping streams of red blood. Subject of terrible tales for children.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +4 (1d8 + tear), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Mirror Jump</strong>. Step inside mirror or other reflective surface within close. Step out of another reflective surface within far.</p><p></p><p><strong>Tear</strong>. Deals an extra die of damage if it hits the same target with both claws.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
